11: /**
12:  * Application owned state, effects and transitions for the Jetpack domain management flow.
13:  *
14:  * <p>The owner holds everything the screens need: the account's domain list (loading, complete,
15:  * empty, error and filtered states), the debounced new-domain search, the purchase modes with
16:  * their cart submission, the typed checkout result and the contained domain details web view.
17:  * Remote work is always requested through the injected {@link Backend}, every observable change is
18:  * published as an effect through the {@link EffectSink}, and screens re-render through
19:  * {@link Observer}.</p>
